        {
          "file": "post.json",
          "layout": "note",
          "carousel": "",
          "quote": "My mom murdered my dad. She became eligible for parole last year. \n\nI couldn’t deal with the potential of her being released before I had looked into what ACTUALLY happened that night so I ordered the case files and dove into my nightmare. \n\nI’m sharing his story, my story, to honor my dad. For too long he suffered in silence. He deserved a voice. He deserved to live.",
